listing:   run.sh (step qemu_pci)
toolchain: QEMU emulator version 8.2.2 (Debian 1:8.2.2+ds-0ubuntu1.18)
command:   qemu-system-x86_64 -machine q35 -nodefaults -display none -serial none -no-reboot -monitor stdio -drive file=.nvme.img,if=none,id=nv0,format=raw -device nvme,serial=HW205NVME,drive=nv0 (monitor: info pci, info qtree after 4 s)
date:      2026-10-09T19:16:22Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container; QEMU with TCG, no KVM)
exit code: 0
hardware:  emulated NVMe controller only; untested on a physical SSD
note:      'quit' ends both monitor sessions; info pci prints the class as 0264 while info qtree prints Class 0108: 0x0108 = 264 in decimal
